**Elderly Launcher** is offered under a **dual-licensing** model by Ltech Consultancy / Bart Luttels.

Required Notice: Copyright (c) Ltech Consultancy / Bart Luttels

## 1. Noncommercial / private use (default public terms)

Unless you have a separate commercial license, this software is licensed under the
**PolyForm Noncommercial License 1.0.0**.

- Full text: [LICENSE-POLYFORM-NONCOMMERCIAL.md](LICENSE-POLYFORM-NONCOMMERCIAL.md)
- Official source: https://polyformproject.org/licenses/noncommercial/1.0.0

Under those terms you may use, modify, and redistribute the software for
**noncommercial and personal purposes** (for example private use on a phone or tablet
for yourself or family). **Commercial use, resale, or offering the software as a
product or paid service requires a commercial license** (see below).

This is **source-available**, not OSI “open source”.

## 2. Commercial license

Ltech Consultancy / Bart Luttels (and any party they authorize) retain the exclusive
right to license the software for **commercial** use and to monetize it.

If you want to:

- sell, redistribute for a fee, or bundle the app commercially,
- use it in a commercial product, service, or organization beyond permitted noncommercial use,
- or otherwise exploit it commercially,

contact the copyright holder for a commercial license:
**https://bartluttels.nl** (or the contact listed in the repository / releases).

## 3. Contributions

Contributions are welcome. By submitting a pull request or other contribution, you
agree to the [Contributor License Agreement](CLA.md). That lets the copyright holder
relicense your contribution under the public noncommercial terms and under commercial
licenses without needing a separate grant for each merge.

## 4. Third-party dependencies

Third-party libraries remain under their own licenses (see Gradle / dependency notices).
